# Two agents, one-wide corridor, ordered to swap ends.
# Catches the EDGE collision: they share no cell at either tick and would walk
# straight through each other. Nowhere to pass, so the only collision-free
# outcome is that one of them does not get through.
version 1
map corridor.map
tick 0.016666667
agent 0 1 1
agent 1 9 1
order 0 0 9 1
order 0 1 1 1
end 60
